    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20051119.0247\n\nBEIJING, Nov. 20 , 2005 (Xinhua)\n\nURGENT: Chinese president to visit US early next year\n\n\n\n\nChinese President Hu Jintao will pay a visit to the United States early next year, according to sources close to the talks between Hu and visiting US President George W. Bush, who offered an invitation, Sunday morning.",
